        },
        {
          "text": " Naye Uria akamwambia Daudi, Sanduku, na Israeli, na Yuda, wanakaa vibandani; na bwana wangu Yoabu, na watumishi wa bwana wangu, wamepiga kambi waziwazi uwandani; nami niende nyumbani kwangu, kula na kunywa, na kulala na mke wangu? Uishivyo, na kama roho yako iishivyo, mimi sitafanya jambo hili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
